# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent Tools IS published (see /agent-tools/), by explicit choice.
#
# Understand what that means: the password check runs in the
# browser, so it is a deterrent, not real security. Anyone can
# read past it in View Source.
#
# What is NOT exposed: the Anthropic API key. It is never stored
# in these files -- Roosevelt types it in at runtime and it stays
# in his browser. Someone bypassing the gate gets an empty
# interface that demands their own key.
#
# What IS exposed: the agent instructions in agent-tools/agents.js
# are publicly readable.
#
# To make this properly secure later, move hosting to Cloudflare
# Pages and put the password check and the API key in a server
# function. See DEPLOY.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Build script -- not needed on the live site
build.py

